<title>THAILAND: Thai M-2 money supply up 13.3 pct yr/yr in Nov.</title>
<headline>Thai M-2 money supply up 13.3 pct yr/yr in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose 13.3 percent year on year in November against a revised 12.8 percent in October, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure rose to an estimated 3.64 trillion baht in November from revised 3.59 trillion in October.</p>
<p>    M-2			 Nov 96     Oct 96	   Nov 95</p>
<p>    Money supply	     3.64	3.59		3.22</p>
<p>    Percentage change     13.30	12.80	     18.4</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
